* _SPECIAL_. This keyword is a shortcut for adding a collection of triggerewords and number of events to one file. It can be used for data insertion only. It is specified in the form of <triggerword> <number of events> [; <triggerword> <number of events> ]. E.g. "triggerevents = central 77; minbias = 65; laser = 1000", means that a given file contains 77 events recorded with central trigger, 65 with minbias trigger and 1000 with a laser trigger.
